e><surname>Engh</surname><given-names>CA</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name><name><surname>Engh</surname><given-names>CA</given-names><suffix>Sr</suffix></name></person-group><article-title>Incidence of late bead shedding from uncemented porous coated cups. A radiographic evaluation</article-title><source>Clin Orthop Relat Res</source><year>1997</year><volume>342</volume><fpage>99</fpage><lpage>105</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9308531</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B7"><label>7</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ebramzadeh</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Sangiorgio</surname><given-names>SN</given-names></name><name><surname>Lattuada</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Kang</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name><name><surname>Chiesa</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Mckellop</surname><given-names>HA</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Accuracy of measurement of polyethylene wear with use of radiographs of total hip replacements</article-title><source>J Bone Joint Surg Am</source><year>2003</year><volume>85A</volume><fpage>2378</fpage><lpage>2384</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14668508</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B8"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Schmalzried</surname><given-names>TP</given-names></name><name><surname>Shepherd</surname><given-names>EF</given-names></name><name><surname>Dorey</surname><given-names>FJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Jackson</surname><given-names>WO</given-names></name><name><surname>dela Rosa</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Fa'vae</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>The John Charnley Award. Wear is a function of use, not time</article-title><source>Clin Orthop Relat Res</source><year>2000</year><volume>381</volume><fpage>36</fpage><lpage>46</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11127668</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B9"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cruess</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name><name><surname>Kwok</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name><name><surname>Duc</surname><given-names>PN</given-names></name><name><surname>Lecavalier</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Dang</surname><given-names>GT</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The response of articular cartilage to weight-bearing against metal. A study of hemiarthroplasty of the hip in the dog</article-title><source>J Bone Joint Surg Br</source><year>1984</year><volume>66</volume><fpage>592</fpage><lpage>597</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6204988</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B10"><label>10</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Minihane</surname><given-names>KP</given-names></name><name><surname>Turner</surname><given-names>TM</given-names></name><name><surname>Urban</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name><name><surname>Williams</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Thonar</surname><given-names>EJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Sumner</surname><given-names>DR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effect of hip hemiarthroplasty on articular cartilage and bone in a canine model</article-title><source>Clin Orthop Relat Res</source><year>2005</year><volume>437</volume><fpage>157</fpage><lpage>163</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16056044</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B11"><label>11</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>van der Meulen</surname><given-names>MC</given-names></name><name><surname>Beaupr&#x000e9;</surname><gi